.DS_Store
__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.envrc

# ROM content never enters the repository (CLAUDE.md section 2). The reference set lives in
# ~/archive/261104-stun-runner/roms; these patterns catch a stray copy or a stray zip.
roms/
*.zip
*.bin
!tools/**/*.bin

# build output (make) and MAME state (root only: asm/nvram/ is source)
build/
/nvram/
/cfg/
/snap/
/sta/

# IDA databases: build artefacts made by `make ida`, never committed (they embed the ROM bytes,
# docs/05-ida.md). The repository commits their annotation snapshots, data/ida/*.json.
data/*.i64
data/*.id0
*.id1
*.id2
*.nam
*.til
